---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import CtaBar from '../components/CtaBar.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="How installation works"
  description="From first measure to final sweep: the Clearveiw Windows installation process for Washington homeowners."
  path="/process"
>
  <section class="wrap section">
    <p class="kicker">Process</p>
    <h1>Measure once. Install clean.</h1>
    <ol class="cards" style="list-style:none;padding:0;">
      <li class="card"><h2>1. Walkthrough</h2><p>We look at the openings, the trim, and what you want to change. You get a written estimate, not a surprise on install day.</p></li>
      <li class="card"><h2>2. Measure and order</h2><p>Each opening is measured for the chosen method. Windows are ordered to those sizes. Lead times vary by manufacturer.</p></li>
      <li class="card"><h2>3. Install</h2><p>Old units come out. New units go in plumb and flashed. Interior and exterior finishes are closed up to match the house.</p></li>
      <li class="card"><h2>4. Walk the job</h2><p>We operate every sash with you, haul debris, and leave the rooms usable. Warranty paperwork stays with you.</p></li>
    </ol>
    <p class="notice">Permits depend on the city and whether the opening changes. We handle that conversation before work starts.</p>
  </section>
  <CtaBar />
</BaseLayout>
